WEBVTT

00:05:58.873 --> 00:06:02.136
Na akaniambia wakati mmoja,
mwanaume aliingia akiwa uchi kabisa.

00:06:02.160 --> 00:06:03.390
(kicheko)

00:06:03.754 --> 00:06:06.262
Nikasema "vyema! niweke mimi
kwenye zamu ya makaburini!"

00:06:06.286 --> 00:06:08.890
(kicheko)

00:06:08.914 --> 00:06:11.705
Sina haja ya kusema,
Waffle House hawakuniajiri.

00:06:13.838 --> 00:06:18.218
Hivyo kwa habari ya kuwa na Aspegaz,
inaweza kuonekana kama tatizo,

00:06:18.242 --> 00:06:20.409
na wakati mwingine ni 
maumivu halisi ya kitako,

00:06:20.433 --> 00:06:22.187
lakini pia ni kinyume chake.

00:06:22.211 --> 00:06:25.802
Ni zawadi, na inaniruhusu mimi
kuwaza kiuvumbuzi.

00:06:26.810 --> 00:06:33.640
Nikiwa na miaka 19, nilishinda shindano
la utafiti, katika tafiti yangu ya miamba maji,